#: properties.py:206
msgid "Model scale as 1:N. The full-size board is divided by N, e.g. 48 for O scale (1:48), 87 for HO (1:87), 1 for full size"
msgstr "模型比例 1:N。实际尺寸的木板会除以 N，例如 O 比例 (1:48) 用 48，HO (1:87) 用 87，实际尺寸用 1。"

#: properties.py:292
msgid "Most knots per board. Set Min and Max to 0 for no knots"
msgstr "每块木板上的最大节疤数。将最小值和最大值设为 0 即可不生成节疤。"

#: operators.py:504
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: operators.py:504
msgid "Name for the preset. Saving under an existing name replaces it"
msgstr "预设的名称。使用已有名称保存会替换该预设。"

#: operators.py:462
msgid "Name of the preset to apply"
msgstr "要应用的预设名称"

#: operators.py:541
msgid "Name of the saved preset to delete"
msgstr "要删除的已保存预设的名称"

#: properties.py:245
msgid "Narrowest growth ring on the long faces, in full-size mm. Smaller = finer, denser grain lines"
msgstr "长面上最窄的生长轮，以实际尺寸毫米为单位。更小 = 木纹线更细、更密。"

#: ui_panel.py:89
msgid "New board settings"
msgstr "新木板设置"

#: properties.py:345
msgid "Number that picks this board's random pattern. The same seed and settings always give the same board; New Seed picks a fresh one"
msgstr "用于选出该木板随机图案的数字。相同的种子和设置始终生成相同的木板；新种子会随机选一个新种子。"

#: operators.py:369
