msgstr "随机度"

#: properties.py:362
msgid "Rebuild the selected board automatically shortly after you change a setting. Turn off to change several settings, then click Regenerate"
msgstr "更改设置后稍后自动重建选中的木板。关闭后可更改多项设置，然后点击重新生成。"

