msgstr "最小特征（毫米）"

#: properties.py:318
msgid "Smallest detail your printer can reliably reproduce, in mm. Used by Auto Detail Boost and Check Printability"
msgstr "打印机可稳定再现的最小细节，单位为毫米。用于自动细节增强和检查可打印性。"

#: properties.py:313
msgid "Spacing between mesh points on the printed board, in mm. Smaller = finer detail but a heavier mesh and slower builds"
msgstr "打印木板上网格点之间的间距，单位为毫米。更小 = 细节更精细，但网格更重、构建更慢。"

#: core/presets.py:52
msgid "TOP"
msgstr "顶部"

#: operators.py:278
msgid "The 4 edges around end A (the left end)"
msgstr "端 A（左端）周围的 4 条边"

#: operators.py:279
msgid "The 4 edges around end B (the right end)"
msgstr "端 B（右端）周围的 4 条边"

#: operators.py:277
msgid "The 4 edges that run the length of the board"
msgstr "沿木板长度方向的 4 条边"

#: properties.py:379
msgid "The preset last applied to these settings"
msgstr "最后应用于这些设置的预设"

#: properties.py:201
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

#: properties.py:35
msgid "Top"
msgstr "顶部"

#: properties.py:333
msgid "Triangle count to simplify down to. On an 8 ft board 20,000 stays within about 0.009 mm of the full mesh; 10,000 (within 0.015 mm) converts faster"
msgstr "简化后的三角形数量。在 8 英尺木板上，20,000 与完整网格的偏差约在 0.009 毫米以内；10,000（偏差在 0.015 毫米以内）转换更快。"

#: properties.py:308
msgid "Type of 3D printer. Choosing one sets sensible Resolution and Smallest Feature values, which you can then adjust"
msgstr "3D 打印机类型。选择一种会设置合理的分辨率和最小特征值，之后你可以再调整。"

#: properties.py:188
msgid "Units"
msgstr "单位"

#: properties.py:188
msgid "Units for Length, Width and Thickness. Weathering settings are always in millimetres"
msgstr "长度、宽度和厚度的单位。风化设置始终以毫米为单位。"

#: properties.py:350
msgid "Use the seed above for new boards instead of a random one, to repeat a board you liked"
msgstr "为新木板使用上方的种子而非随机种子，以重现你喜欢的木板。"

