msgstr "要设置的边"

#: properties.py:250
msgid "Widest growth ring on the long faces, in full-size mm. Rings vary between Min and Max, like fast and slow growth years"
msgstr "长面上最宽的生长轮，以实际尺寸毫米计。生长轮在最小值与最大值之间变化，如同快生年与慢生年"

#: properties.py:196
msgid "Width"
msgstr "宽度"

#: properties.py:240
msgid "Width of a smooth, unworn border around each weathered face, in full-size mm. 0 = the wear runs right out over the edges"
msgstr "每个风化面周围平滑未磨损边框的宽度，以实际尺寸毫米计。0 = 磨损一直延伸到边缘"

#: operators.py:369
msgid "Write each board to its own file, named after the file name chosen plus the board's name"
msgstr "将每块木板写入单独的文件，文件名由所选文件名加木板名称组成"

#: ui_panel.py:66
msgid "carving fades. Use Auto Detail Boost."
msgstr "雕刻渐隐。使用自动细节增强。"

